Leaf_Text_ViridianCall::
	.string "LEAF: {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "Over here!$"

Leaf_Text_ViridianGreeting::
	.string "LEAF: My twin brother,\n"
	.string "finally on the road!\p"
	.string "MOM said you were getting\n"
	.string "ready. I had to come see you.$"

Leaf_Text_ViridianSabrina::
	.string "SABRINA! It's good to see you.\n"
	.string "Keeping him company?\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, try not to spend\n"
	.string "every date training!$"

Leaf_Text_ViridianSabrinaReply::
	.string "SABRINA: I know his habits.\n"
	.string "I've had years to learn them.$"

Leaf_Text_ViridianBadges::
	.string "LEAF opens her BADGE CASE.\n"
	.string "Two BADGES gleam inside.\p"
	.string "LEAF: The BOULDERBADGE\n"
	.string "and the CASCADEBADGE!\p"
	.string "BROCK and MISTY were tough.\n"
	.string "We had some great battles!\p"
	.string "Two in three months? I know.\n"
	.string "I'm taking the scenic route.$"

Leaf_Text_ViridianEevee::
	.string "There are people to meet\n"
	.string "and places to explore.\p"
	.string "EEVEE likes our little stops.\n"
	.string "I think you would, too.$"

Leaf_Text_ViridianFarewell::
	.string "Enjoy the journey, you two!\n"
	.string "And keep in touch with MOM.\p"
	.string "I'll see you farther along.\n"
	.string "Don't forget to look around!$"

Leaf_Text_ViridianSabrinaFarewell::
	.string "SABRINA: Take care, LEAF.\n"
	.string "We will.$"

Leaf_Text_Cerulean::
	.string "LEAF: There's my twin!\n"
	.string "How is your team coming along?\p"
	.string "EEVEE and I found a nice path\n"
	.string "by the water. Try it sometime!\p"
	.string "Remember our visits to SAFFRON?\n"
	.string "I found SABRINA strange.\p"
	.string "Then she found my lost ribbon\n"
	.string "without leaving her chair.\p"
	.string "We've got along ever since.$"

Leaf_Text_CeruleanSabrina::
	.string "SABRINA: You hid it yourself.\n"
	.string "To test whether I'd find it.\p"
	.string "LEAF: And you still helped!$"

Leaf_Text_Lavender::
	.string "LEAF: People here are grieving.\n"
	.string "Their POKéMON were family.\p"
	.string "And TEAM ROCKET treats them\n"
	.string "like things to buy and sell…\p"
	.string "I can't ignore that.\n"
	.string "MR. FUJI's friends need help.\p"
	.string "Be careful in the TOWER, okay?$"

Leaf_Text_LavenderSabrina::
	.string "SABRINA: Stay with them, LEAF.\n"
	.string "They need a patient friend.$"

Leaf_Text_LavenderSafe::
	.string "LEAF: MR. FUJI is safe!\n"
	.string "Thank you, {PLAYER}.\p"
	.string "EEVEE stayed with a frightened\n"
	.string "little CUBONE all afternoon.\p"
	.string "I'm heading toward SAFFRON.\n"
	.string "Keep looking after each other.$"

Leaf_Text_SaffronRockets::
	.string "LEAF: I know that look.\n"
	.string "SABRINA, you're worried.\p"
	.string "I'll help people get home.\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}, don't rush in blindly.$"

Leaf_Text_SaffronSabrina::
	.string "SABRINA: I remember you hiding\n"
	.string "behind him when we were small.\p"
	.string "LEAF: Now I look out for him.\n"
	.string "We both do.$"

Leaf_Text_WaterStone::
	.string "LEAF: The city feels safer now.\n"
	.string "I have something to show you.\p"
	.string "EEVEE loves the water.\n"
	.string "A WATER STONE just for her.$"

Leaf_Text_EeveeChoice::
	.string "LEAF offers a WATER STONE.\n"
	.string "EEVEE touches it eagerly…$"

Leaf_Text_Vaporeon::
	.string "EEVEE evolved into VAPOREON!\p"
	.string "LEAF: Beautiful, isn't she?\n"
	.string "We'll walk along the shore.$"

Leaf_Text_SaffronVaporeon::
	.string "LEAF: VAPOREON loves our walks\n"
	.string "along the coast. So do I.\p"
	.string "SABRINA's GYM voice is serious.\n"
	.string "Her voice with you is softer.\p"
	.string "Don't worry. I won't tease her.\n"
	.string "Much.$"
